{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"T0空间"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑学"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"T0 空间"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>$T_0$ 空间是满足如下等价条件的拓扑空间 $X$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对任意 $x,y\\in X$, 若 $x\\neq y$, 则要么存在 $x$ 的开邻域 $U$ 不包含 $y$, 要么存在 $y$ 的开邻域 $U$ 不包含 $x$.</li>\n<li>其"},{"Local":{"url":"Alexandroff拓扑","text":"特化预序"}},{"Plain":"为"},{"Local":{"url":"偏序集","text":"偏序"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}